Title: Morning Coffee
Credit: Written by
Author: Framecraft test script
Draft date: 2026-11-09

INT. NEIGHBORHOOD CAFE - MORNING

Soft light through tall windows. A round oak table with two bentwood chairs sits by the window. LEO (30s), in a dark apron, wipes the counter beside a pastry display.

MAYA (20s), ochre jumper, enters and takes the chair by the window.

LEO
Morning. The usual?

MAYA
One flat white, please.

Leo sets a ceramic mug on a saucer in front of her. Maya wraps both hands around the cup and smiles.

MAYA (CONT'D)
(quietly)
First quiet morning in a week.

EXT. CAFE STREET - CONTINUOUS

Maya steps out onto the sidewalk with a paper cup. A bicycle leans against a lamp post.

LEO (O.S.)
See you tomorrow!

She waves without looking back.
